# KI-012: A recovered reaction product becomes a catalyst for a second reaction
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 KMnO4 0.00004mol
add v1 ethanol 0.00003mol
inspect v1
new
filter v1 v2
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H2O2 0.001mol
new
add v3 water 100mL
add v3 H2O2 0.001mol
wait 30s
inspect
